makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">“Demi Allah! Sesungguhnya kami (semasa di dunia dahulu) adalah di dalam kesesatan yang jelas nyata,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإنما كانت هذه التسوية في المحبة والتعظيم والعبادة كما هو حال أكثر مشركي العالم<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/348</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s26a97\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/26-57.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (26:57)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/26-98.html\">Ayat seterusnya (26:98)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-98.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:98 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"“&#x27; Kerana kami menyamakan kamu dengan Tuhan sekalian alam;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-98.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:98 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"“&#x27; Kerana kami menyamakan kamu dengan Tuhan sekalian alam;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/26.html\">Surah Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Ayat 98</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:98</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِذْ نُسَوِّيكُم بِرَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">“&#x27; Kerana kami menyamakan kamu dengan Tuhan sekalian alam;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنهم يعدلون آلهتهم برب العالمين.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/358</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">مع إقرارهم بأن الله وحده خالق كل شيء، وربه ومليكه، وأن آلهتهم لا تخلق ولا ترزق، ولا تحيي ولا تميت، وإنما كانت هذه التسوية في المحبة والتعظيم والعبادة<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/348</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">مع إقرارهم بأن الله وحده خالق كل شيء، وربه ومليكه، وأن آلهتهم لا تخلق ولا ترزق<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/348</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s26a98\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/26-97.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (26:97)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/26-105.html\">Ayat seterusnya (26:105)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}